# A stray control byte must never make a source file "binary" to git —
# that silently turns its diff into "Binary files differ" and the change
# becomes unreviewable. Force a textual diff without touching line endings.
*.ts      diff
*.tsx     diff
*.svelte  diff
*.js      diff
*.mjs     diff
*.cjs     diff
*.json    diff
*.md      diff
*.css     diff
*.html    diff
*.svg     diff
*.yml     diff
*.yaml    diff
*.sh      diff
